        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Yamada family will never know what bit them. You are Mister Mosquito, an uninvited guest in the Yamada's family home in Japan. In order to store up enough food for the coming winter, you will need to drink as much of their precious blood as possible while they are in bed, talking on the phone, watching tv, or even taking a bath. The Yamada family knows you are in the house, and they have plans to take you out. Deadly insecticides fill the air, and members of the family have the ability to crush you like a bug. You want a taste of their plasma. They want you dead. Something's gotta give.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La familia Yamada nunca sabrá qué les picó. Eres Mister Mosquito, un huésped no invitado en el hogar de la familia Yamada en Japón. Para almacenar suficiente comida para el próximo invierno, deberás beber la mayor cantidad posible de su preciosa sangre mientras duermen, hablan por teléfono, ven la televisión o incluso se bañan. La familia Yamada sabe que estás en la casa y planea eliminarte. Insecticidas letales llenan el aire, y los miembros de la familia pueden aplastarte como a un insecto. Tú quieres probar su plasma. Ellos quieren verte muerto. Algo tiene que ceder.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2001",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
